@host = http://localhost:5148

### 1. Cadastrar a fazenda
# @name createFarm
POST {{host}}/api/farms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fazenda Santa Rita",
  "city": "Sorriso",
  "state": "MT",
  "headquarters": { "latitude": -12.5453, "longitude": -55.7211 }
}

### 2. Desenhar o talhao
# O contorno e exatamente o que o Leaflet-Geoman produz: GeoJSON Polygon, posicoes em
# [longitude, latitude]. O quadrado abaixo tem aproximadamente 1 km de lado, ou seja ~100 ha —
# confira o campo areaHectares da resposta.
# @name createField
POST {{host}}/api/fields
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmId": "{{createFarm.response.body.id}}",
  "name": "Talhao Norte",
  "crop": "Soybean",
  "boundary": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [[
      [-55.7211, -12.5453],
      [-55.7119, -12.5453],
      [-55.7119, -12.5363],
      [-55.7211, -12.5363],
      [-55.7211, -12.5453]
    ]]
  }
}

### 3. Listar os talhoes da fazenda (e o que o mapa consome)
GET {{host}}/api/farms/{{createFarm.response.body.id}}/fields

### 4. Contorno auto-interseccionado — deve responder 422 geo.invalid_polygon
POST {{host}}/api/fields
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmId": "{{createFarm.response.body.id}}",
  "name": "No de gravata",
  "crop": "Soybean",
  "boundary": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [[
      [-55.7211, -12.5453],
      [-55.7119, -12.5363],
      [-55.7119, -12.5453],
      [-55.7211, -12.5363],
      [-55.7211, -12.5453]
    ]]
  }
}

### 5. Talhao sobreposto ao do passo 2 — deve responder 409 field.overlaps_another
POST {{host}}/api/fields
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmId": "{{createFarm.response.body.id}}",
  "name": "Talhao Invasor",
  "crop": "Corn",
  "boundary": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [[
      [-55.7165, -12.5408],
      [-55.7075, -12.5408],
      [-55.7075, -12.5320],
      [-55.7165, -12.5320],
      [-55.7165, -12.5408]
    ]]
  }
}

### 6. Talhao vizinho encostado na divisa — deve ser ACEITO (201)
POST {{host}}/api/fields
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmId": "{{createFarm.response.body.id}}",
  "name": "Talhao Leste",
  "crop": "Corn",
  "boundary": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [[
      [-55.7119, -12.5453],
      [-55.7027, -12.5453],
      [-55.7027, -12.5363],
      [-55.7119, -12.5363],
      [-55.7119, -12.5453]
    ]]
  }
}

### 7. Nome repetido na mesma fazenda — deve responder 409 field.duplicate_name
POST {{host}}/api/fields
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmId": "{{createFarm.response.body.id}}",
  "name": "talhao norte",
  "crop": "Cotton",
  "boundary": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [[
      [-55.6900, -12.5453],
      [-55.6808, -12.5453],
      [-55.6808, -12.5363],
      [-55.6900, -12.5363],
      [-55.6900, -12.5453]
    ]]
  }
}

### 8. Desativar o talhao (preserva o historico)
PATCH {{host}}/api/fields/{{createField.response.body.id}}/status?active=false

### 9. Excluir a fazenda com talhoes — deve responder 409 farm.has_fields
DELETE {{host}}/api/farms/{{createFarm.response.body.id}}
